00:07:22.884 --> 00:07:25.264
So you can ask me questions.

00:07:25.264 --> 00:07:26.947
You can ask me questions as well.

00:07:28.317 --> 00:07:30.844
I'm hoping we can get this
cause this so many things

00:07:30.844 --> 00:07:31.777
I wanna ask him.

00:07:33.934 --> 00:07:35.667
Let's see, where is,

00:07:37.014 --> 00:07:42.014
so let's Shrin Shivash
Novi rather Krishnan.

00:07:45.254 --> 00:07:47.874
Why do you think what you're
doing is helping kids like me?

00:07:47.874 --> 00:07:51.454
Well, I hope it's
helping students like you

00:07:51.454 --> 00:07:53.944
because that's the whole
goal of Khan Academy

00:07:53.944 --> 00:07:56.414
for that any student, whether
they're in a classroom

00:07:56.414 --> 00:07:58.484
or outside of the classroom
to really be able to learn

00:07:58.484 --> 00:08:00.704
at their own time and
pace and fill any gaps

00:08:00.704 --> 00:08:03.254
that they have at their
