to do that and exercise that,

00:08:11.764 --> 00:08:14.204
I think you'll just
somewhat get addicted to it.

00:08:14.204 --> 00:08:15.744
And obviously if you
get addicted to learning

00:08:15.744 --> 00:08:17.204
you're going to be very well empowered,

00:08:17.204 --> 00:08:18.354
the rest of your life.

00:08:18.354 --> 00:08:21.134
People who are auto learners are the ones

00:08:21.134 --> 00:08:23.214
that are really
unstoppable in our society,

00:08:23.214 --> 00:08:24.784
especially society that index

00:08:24.784 --> 00:08:27.404
is more and more on learning.

00:08:27.404 --> 00:08:29.824
Let's see other feel
