00:08:50.664 --> 00:08:55.564
So Arne, what is, if you, well,

00:08:55.564 --> 00:08:58.504
if you were whatever the
next administration is,

00:08:58.504 --> 00:09:00.594
if you found yourself or you're advising

00:09:00.594 --> 00:09:02.284
